    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nuts About Nuts</strong> is a lively and cooperative \u201cstress-free\u201d factory simulation game where teamwork and precision are the keys to success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun and fast-paced experience, players can team up to run a bustling factory floor, selecting specialized tools and using their unique skills to manufacture and deliver increasingly complex parts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you work together or alone, the goal is to keep the assembly line moving efficiently while ensuring your friends stay in sync. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more parts you successfully create and deliver, the more money you earn, enabling you to progress through your company's journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/683ec334bdd4156bca274bc3ac7ed81c.poster.avif?t=1744262951\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/683ec334bdd4156bca274bc3ac7ed81c.webm?t=1744262951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/683ec334bdd4156bca274bc3ac7ed81c.mp4?t=1744262951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/296c048170e23b6709cba4fe139098aa.avif?t=1744262951\" width=800 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Create your own manufacturing company</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 A variety of machines and equipment to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 unlock, buy, and use in your factory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Automate your production</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Custom layout for your factory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Personalize your company and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 your co-op team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Character customization system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Purchase a variety of perks to boost </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 your speed and progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Buy factory buildings to manufacture </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 different parts that earn you more money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/8649b8f0db3e05cb180efef2bbd68fe7.poster.avif?t=1744262951\" width=590 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/8649b8f0db3e05cb180efef2bbd68fe7.webm?t=1744262951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/8649b8f0db3e05cb180efef2bbd68fe7.mp4?t=1744262951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for casual and dedicated gamers, <strong>Nuts About Nuts</strong> combines the challenges of machining and manufacturing with a playful and engaging atmosphere. With its vibrant art style and dynamic gameplay, the factory floor becomes your playground as you master the art of crafting and delivering the perfect product. Whether working with a group of friends or alone, you\u2019ll need coordination, quick thinking, and a solid plan to keep things running smoothly. Get ready to dive into a world of industrial fun and see just how \u201cnuts\u201d you can get in this entertaining cooperative adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/7583e48b5a86e9617e3fde2ad0652858.poster.avif?t=1744262951\" width=596 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/7583e48b5a86e9617e3fde2ad0652858.webm?t=1744262951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/7583e48b5a86e9617e3fde2ad0652858.mp4?t=1744262951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nuts About Nuts</strong> is a lively and cooperative \u201cstress-free\u201d factory simulation game where teamwork and precision are the keys to success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun and fast-paced experience, players can team up to run a bustling factory floor, selecting specialized tools and using their unique skills to manufacture and deliver increasingly complex parts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you work together or alone, the goal is to keep the assembly line moving efficiently while ensuring your friends stay in sync. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more parts you successfully create and deliver, the more money you earn, enabling you to progress through your company's journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/683ec334bdd4156bca274bc3ac7ed81c.poster.avif?t=1744262951\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/683ec334bdd4156bca274bc3ac7ed81c.webm?t=1744262951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/683ec334bdd4156bca274bc3ac7ed81c.mp4?t=1744262951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250220/extras/296c048170e23b6709cba4fe139098aa.avif?t=1744262951\" width=800 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Create your own manufacturing company</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 A variety of machines and equipment to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \